			(FACTION)ACT1_UND_PetrifiedDrow_Drow_6a05bdb0-d46a-4ecc-9740-f32e39928448, (FACTION)ACT1_UND_PetrifiedDrow_DrowCharmed_1a5300f3-3abd-475e-a1f8-9c1fd2b9bfe7,
